page('index.html','Current short-let rules across the UK',f'<p class="lead">Licensing, planning, tax and safety rules for UK holiday-let and short-term-let hosts, with links to official sources.</p><div class="grid">{cards}</div><h2>Free tools</h2><ul><li><a href="checker.html"><b>Do I need a licence or registration for my short let?</b></a> (pick your nation and council; <a href="embed.html">embed it on your site</a>)</li><li><a href="wales-registration-checker.html">Wales: do I need to register with the WRA?</a> (4-question checker)</li><li><a href="scotland-business-rates-checker.html">Scotland: business rates or council tax?</a> (140/70 nights checker)</li><li><a href="scotland-short-term-let-licence-guide.html">Scotland: how to get a short-term let licence</a> (steps and checklist)</li><li><a href="london-90-night-counter.html">London: 90-night rule counter</a> (add bookings from every platform)</li><li><a href="uk-visitor-levy-map.html">UK visitor levy and tourist tax map</a></li><li><a href="buyer-due-diligence-checker.html">Buyer due-diligence checker</a> (buying a holiday let? local rules by postcode plus lender, insurance and lease checks)</li><li><a href="occupancy-threshold-tracker.html">Occupancy threshold tracker</a> (Wales 182/252, England and Scotland 70/140 nights; email your accountant)</li><li><a href="deadlines.html">UK short-let deadlines: next 90 days</a> (shareable card)</li><li><a href="levy-calculator.html">Visitor levy calculator</a> (Edinburgh, Glasgow, Aberdeen, Stirling, West Dunbartonshire, Cardiff; guest message and embed)</li><li><a href="holiday-let-tax-after-fhl-abolition.html">Holiday let tax after the FHL abolition</a> (UK-wide guide)</li><li><a href="holiday-let-fire-safety-england.html">England: holiday let fire safety rules and checklist</a></li><li><a href="england-second-homes-council-tax-premium.html">England: second homes council tax premium and exceptions</a></li><li><a href="wales-second-homes-council-tax-premium.html">Wales: second homes council tax premium (up to 300%) and exceptions</a></li><li><a href="holiday-let-fire-safety-wales.html">Wales: holiday let fire safety rules and checklist</a></li><li><a href="short-term-let-fire-safety-scotland.html">Scotland: short-term let fire safety rules and checklist</a></li><li><a href="northern-ireland-tourism-certificate-guide.html">Northern Ireland: how to get a Tourism NI certificate</a> (fees, inspection, checklist)</li></ul><h2>Latest changes</h2><ul>{latest}</ul><p><a href="changes.html">Full changes log</a></p><div class="box"><h2>Weekly "what changed" email</h2><p>One short, sourced email a week. Unsubscribe any time.</p>'+FORM+'</div>')
