 levy=('No decision. Consultation on whether Moray should introduce a visitor levy at all opened 2 Sep 2026 and runs to 31 Oct 2026. If the council goes ahead, a draft scheme would get a further public consultation before any final decision.',['https://newsroom.moray.gov.uk/news/council-consults-on-visitor-levy-for-moray']),
 fees=('From 1 Apr 2026: licence or renewal £540 (same for new and existing operators); temporary licence £540; provisional licence £220; confirmation of a provisional licence £320; transfer £309; variation £30; copy of licence £24; inspection £220. Planning, Building Standards and Environmental Health charge separately. Fees are not refunded if an application is refused.',['https://www.moray.gov.uk/law-and-licensing/licences-permits-and-permissions/property-licences/property-licence-fees/','https://www.moray.gov.uk/law-and-licensing/licensing-and-licences/licence-fees/']),
