 levy=('No levy yet. On 17 September 2025 the Leadership Board authorised officers to begin formal stakeholder consultation and develop a visitor levy proposition, after an estimate that a 5% levy could raise about £2m a year before costs. We found no published consultation or scheme since (searched 24 Oct 2026). Any Scottish levy needs at least 18 months\' notice.',[RENL]),
 fees=('Application fees from 1 April 2026, by bedrooms let (1 / 2 / 3 / 4 or more). Home letting, home sharing or both: £291 / £407 / £407 / £407. Secondary letting: £927 / £1,043 / £1,159 / £1,274. Provisional licence: home £189 / £264 / £264 / £264, secondary £603 / £678 / £754 / £829; confirming it then costs home £213 / £254 / £254 / £254, secondary £435 / £476 / £516 / £557. Temporary exemption £117, variation £117, material change of circumstances £117, transfer £89, certified duplicate or true copy £48, inspection after a complaint £156.87 an hour. Fees are not refunded if you are refused or withdraw. <span class="tag warn">check with council</span> The council does not publish a separate renewal fee, so confirm what you will pay to renew with licensing.cs@renfrewshire.gov.uk.',[REN]),
